msgstr "質問"

#. translators: %d: largest number of questions.
#: includes/class-admin.php:769
msgid "Shown in the panel as examples a visitor can tap. Up to %d. Empty fields are ignored."
msgstr "訪問者がタップして使える質問の例として、パネルに表示します。%d件まで登録できます。空欄は無視されます。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:782
msgid "Put it into the question field"
msgstr "質問欄に入力する"

#: includes/class-admin.php:786
msgid "Open the AI service at once"
msgstr "すぐにAIサービスを開く"

#. translators: %d: number of the question.
#: includes/class-admin.php:826
